t/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_f5ef9a005278e374f023e9279989be02.png","video":null,"cd":null,"cost":null,"is_passive":true,"tags":[{"name":"Buff","rgb":"79,156,184"}]},{"id":7310,"name":"Synchro Fission","description":"Harith creates a phantom of himself in a distant location. Harith and his phantom then release Synchro Fission toward each other, dealing 150 (+60% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage to all enemy units on the path.\n\nWhen the 2 energy waves collide, they explode, dealing 450 (+180% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage to all enemies in the area.\nThis skill deals 60% extra damage to creeps (up to 1500 damage).","icon":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_5f23c4399892794ed73e58a29352273c.png","video":null,"cd":5.0,"cost":50.0,"is_passive":false,"tags":[{"name":"AOE","rgb":"199,121,85"}]},{"id":7320,"name":"Chrono Dash","description":"Harith dashes towards the target direction, gaining a 120 (+120% Total Magic Power) shield that stacks up to 3 times and enhancing his next Basic Attack. His enhanced Basic Attack deals 200 (+100% Total Physical Attack)(+60% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage and slows enemies by 40%. Hitting an enemy reduces the cooldown of Chrono Dash by 3s.\n\nThe enhanced Basic Attack only deals 50 (+100% Total Physical Attack)(+100% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage to Turrets.","icon":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_1a0db4fd70a127b1733a6fc10261d4c5.png","video":null,"cd":9.3,"cost":50.0,"is_passive":false,"tags":[{"name":"Mobility","rgb":"162,105,198"},{"name":"Buff","rgb":"79,156,184"}]},{"id":7330,"name":"Zaman Force","description":"Harith uses his Key to summon the Zaman Force, creating a multidimensional rift. Upon appearing, it reduces the cooldown of Chrono Dash by 4s. The rift continuously slows enemy heroes in the area by 40%.\n\nWhen Harith comes into contact with the rift using Chrono Dash, he absorbs its energy, reducing the cooldown of Synchro Fission by 1s and Chrono Dash by 3s. Harith gains 15% Resilience while on the rift.","icon":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_47c6f8c53a894420ae9c8ae05a81fa47.png","video":null,"cd":40.0,"cost":120.0,"is_passive":false,"tags":[{"name":"Buff","rgb":"79,156,184"},{"name":"Slow","rgb":"205,93,109"}]}],"counters":{"assist":{"desc":"Harith pairs well with heroes who have AOE CC and can make it harder for enemies to escape his Ultimate's range, such as Minsitthar and Minotaur.","heroes":[{"id":74,"name":"Minsitthar","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_c5d24a1dad6cef21de2698a4ed1d80ce.png"},{"id":19,"name":"Minotaur","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_3ecd2c0843df7ec85044dafff6bf4553.png"}]},"strong":{"desc":"Harith is a very agile hero and his Ultimate reduces the duration of control effects, so he is excellent at countering heroes who rely on CC and have relatively long casting animations, like Belerick and Johnson.","heroes":[{"id":70,"name":"Belerick","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_5f2a9eca0bafd4ed8dc39a93c771b3af.png"},{"id":32,"name":"Johnson","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_85ff988c6660b4d04f8dd3d40df988bb.png"}]},"weak":{"desc":"Harith is countered by heroes who can quickly escape from his Ultimate, such as Novaria and Pharsa.","heroes":[{"id":119,"name":"Novaria","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_57eeea6d5bd8d21229de8df79751db9f.png"},{"id":52,"name":"Pharsa","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_10151d43910e62f7aa9ce08df481a20f.png"}]}},"skins":[{"name":"Christmas Carnival","name_slug":"Christmas-Carnival","image":"https://esportpedia.b-cdn.net/mlbbhub/skins/harith/Harith-Christmas-Carnival-20240123101837.webp"